    "title": "Cartoon and illustration collection of 'technology and life' - Chinadaily.com.cn",
    "text": "The \"International Cartoon and Illustration Exhibition on a Community with a Shared Future for Humanity 2025\", jointly organized by China Daily and Bank of China Beijing Branch, is now open for global submissions. The deadline is August 15.\nWe invite you to enjoy the third collection of selected entries from around the world. For submissions and more information, please visit: https://artcontest.chinadaily.com.cn/2025.html\nTechnology turns dreams into reality – let's pick up our brushes, and use creativity to explore the fusion of technology and life!",
